    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/02fcf6cd1c23e13459883700bcd62c81.poster.avif?t=1753650882\" width=609 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/02fcf6cd1c23e13459883700bcd62c81.webm?t=1753650882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dead Aim </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use precision targeting to disable vital components and cripple the opposition.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/a66ce1eb3d5f1db3e616f21692c00122.poster.avif?t=1753650882\" width=609 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/a66ce1eb3d5f1db3e616f21692c00122.webm?t=1753650882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/e497f9ad884cde5a6e19d079fbdb2100.poster.avif?t=1753650882\" width=609 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/e497f9ad884cde5a6e19d079fbdb2100.webm?t=1753650882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chaos Fingerprint</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based interactions allow for hundreds of unique explosions and cinematic fatalities.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/93a6910794cf6846f676de515e7dcc8b.poster.avif?t=1753650882\" width=609 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/93a6910794cf6846f676de515e7dcc8b.webm?t=1753650882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meaningful Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicles and drivers have unique Active and Passive abilities that fundamentally alter the game. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/ddcf72f32dd3a3a406e36b6a7c646b7a.poster.avif?t=1753650882\" width=609 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/ddcf72f32dd3a3a406e36b6a7c646b7a.webm?t=1753650882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/66b01547edc2687c045969a8ab1b7de8.poster.avif?t=1753650882\" width=609 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/66b01547edc2687c045969a8ab1b7de8.webm?t=1753650882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/6e4fe5c85308f5a84fb9e970b9320222.poster.avif?t=1753650882\" width=609 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/6e4fe5c85308f5a84fb9e970b9320222.webm?t=1753650882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/89df903963f2b6e809b58d9afd4e9760.poster.avif?t=1753650882\" width=609 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/89df903963f2b6e809b58d9afd4e9760.webm?t=1753650882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedural FX</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullet holes, scorch marks, and dirt accumulation varies based on the impacted material.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/b0afa7f9ea32e121ff297f7281b88907.poster.avif?t=1753650882\" width=609 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/b0afa7f9ea32e121ff297f7281b88907.webm?t=1753650882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Foliage and Seasons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your vehicle interacts with the foliage in the environment. Seasonal changes can impact vehicle and weapon performance.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/ff723d6448ce71f5a2d45d8390405599.poster.avif?t=1753650882\" width=609 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/ff723d6448ce71f5a2d45d8390405599.webm?t=1753650882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*With GPU and CPU performance in mind, precalculated physics interactions  reduce your gaming device's real-time hardware demand.</i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in 5-minute deathmatches that culminate in a challenging boss-fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/b0afa7f9ea32e121ff297f7281b88907.poster.avif?t=1753650882\" width=609 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/b0afa7f9ea32e121ff297f7281b88907.webm?t=1753650882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock, equip, and upgrade components to enhance vehicle performance. Obtain powerful vehicle and weapon augments hidden throughout the battlefield.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apply skins, paints, and decals to make it yours.\u00a0More importantly:\u00a0Stay Metal\u00a0\ud83e\udd18\u00a0</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>FAQ</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Will this be released for consoles?</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > PC, PS5, and Xbox. Steam Deck and VR are unconfirmed at this time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>When can I try it?</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Demo is available now for Windows PC.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Will it have gamepad and wheel support?</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes and yes. However, early builds of the Demo may not have full controller support.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Linux, MacOS, Steam Deck, Switch?</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To be confirmed.</p>",
